1
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,430
What a big fish.

2
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,830
I hope I didn't crush it to death.

3
00:00:53,230 --> 00:00:54,690
How can water grab people?

4
00:01:02,030 --> 00:01:02,700
It's hard.

5
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:03,760
It's warm.

6
00:01:04,330 --> 00:01:05,099
These are...

7
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,460
pecs.

8
00:01:19,130 --> 00:01:20,660
I didn't mean to.

9
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:22,060
The water started it.

10
00:01:29,630 --> 00:01:30,700
Who are you?

11
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:39,759
Let me go!

12
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:01,500
Li.

13
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,600
Is it you?

14
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:07,360
I don't know you.

15
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:10,830
You are not her.

16
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:15,900
Am I going to die?

17
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:18,200
But I don't even

18
00:02:18,730 --> 00:02:20,360
remember who I am.

19
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,000
Don't be afraid.

20
00:02:23,230 --> 00:02:24,700
Follow the bell

21
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:25,960
and go home.

22
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:28,660
Go home?

23
00:02:29,829 --> 00:02:32,860
Where is my home?

24
00:02:35,530 --> 00:02:36,930
Master, bad news!

25
00:02:36,930 --> 00:02:38,660
There's a telepathic message.

26
00:02:42,530 --> 00:02:44,030
Sorry, Master.

27
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,800
I didn't know you were...

28
00:02:48,730 --> 00:02:49,730
What happened?

29
00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:50,329
Speak.

30
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:54,230
The divine beast suddenly woke up.

31
00:02:55,730 --> 00:02:57,460
Help me take her and Bai back.

32
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:03,860
For thousands of years,

33
00:03:04,130 --> 00:03:06,660
the Master has never shown
interest in women.

34
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:09,330
Today he actually took the initiative
to get close.

35
00:03:09,330 --> 00:03:11,860
Is the old iron tree finally blooming?

36
00:03:21,530 --> 00:03:23,230
Master, you're back.

37
00:03:25,329 --> 00:03:26,530
Where is that girl?

38
00:03:29,730 --> 00:03:30,800
In your room.

39
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,420
She's probably not up yet.

40
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:35,860
Ye Qifeng,

41
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,200
you've got some nerve, haven't you?

42
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:40,660
How dare you send just anyone to my room?

43
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:44,660
Oh no.

44
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,360
I think I misunderstood.

45
00:03:47,630 --> 00:03:49,400
Does the Master like wild...

46
00:03:50,829 --> 00:03:52,960
Swallow those two words in your heart.

47
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:55,130
Master,

48
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,660
you read my mind again.

49
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,800
It's written all over your face.

50
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:03,460
You definitely read it.

51
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:08,760
Master,

52
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,000
I've already checked.

53
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,130
She's just a mortal.

54
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:12,900
But last night the Eye of Gods
and Demons was opened,

55
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:14,200
the divine beast awakened,

56
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,300
and a mortal fell from the sky.

57
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:16,560
Bai was injured again.

58
00:04:16,829 --> 00:04:19,690
Do you think she could be a spy
from the Demonic Cult?

59
00:04:35,659 --> 00:04:36,430
Uncle,

60
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,030
if there is a next life,

61
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:39,830
I will be your wife again.

62
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,800
Li.

63
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:44,300
Could it be you?

64
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,230
I don't know where I am,

65
00:04:56,230 --> 00:04:58,030
but this food is amazing.

66
00:04:58,159 --> 00:04:59,300
I'll eat first.

67
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:02,160
I need a full stomach
to figure out how to escape.

68
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,430
It's the guy with the hard pecs
from last night.

69
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:16,960
No.

70
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:19,230
It's the guy
who almost choked me to death.

71
00:05:19,230 --> 00:05:21,630
Is he going to make me pay
for that fish with my life?

72
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,100
No way.

73
00:05:22,230 --> 00:05:23,260
I have to find a way to escape.
